        5("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Predefined Command Catalog</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm and typed .NET requests]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Registers typed IDE commands<br />and queries with stable IDs<br />and required capabilities.<br />Pairs UI commands with<br />Toolkit bindings and<br />localized metadata. Supplies<br />the MCP tool registry.</div>")
